{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyMzYzMA==","is_bot":false,"login":"rparcus","name":"Robert Parcus"},"body":"## Overview\nImplement capabilities for managing Telegram groups and channels, providing advanced moderation and administration capabilities.\n\n## Core Features\n- Member management (add, remove, restrict)\n- Permission management\n- Content moderation\n- Spam protection\n- Group settings management\n- Channel post management\n- Admin action logging\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Complete group management prisms\n- [ ] Permission system implementation\n- [ ] Moderation action handlers\n- [ ] Admin logging system\n- [ ] Documentation and examples\n- [ ] Test coverage > 90%\n- [ ] Performance optimization\n\n## Budget: $1,800","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc6gr19J","author":{"login":"DicksonWu654"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"I'm going to work on this too. Will create a branch that forks: https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/pull/134's branch","createdAt":"2025-03-04T00:04:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-2695847753","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc7pwPRH","author":{"login":"addidea"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'm interested in taking on this Telegram group management feature. I have bot development experience and can implement the moderation system with comprehensive test coverage. My fork: https://github.com/addidea/lux","createdAt":"2026-02-18T16:14:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-3921736775","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCHMtQw","author":{"login":"Treasure520520"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #65\\n\\nI am submitting a focused Telegram group-management foundation: moderation action planning, permission templates, admin log entries, and safe parameter normalization for bot/group workflows. This is intentionally scoped to reduce overlap with broad competing PRs while still covering acceptance criteria around permission systems, moderation handlers, admin logging, docs, and tests.","createdAt":"2026-05-13T02:53:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4436733251","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCQ0ngw","author":{"login":"BigPolarBear"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #65\n\nSubmitted PR #554 for the Telegram Group Management bounty: https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/pull/554\n\nIt adds a deterministic group/channel management planner covering member actions, permission templates, role matrices, moderation, spam protection, group settings, channel posts, admin audit logs, and a `Lux.Prisms.Telegram.Group.ManageGroup` prism for agent workflows.\n\nVerification completed locally:\n- `mix test.unit test/unit/lux/integrations/telegram/group_manager_test.exs test/unit/lux/prisms/telegram/group/manage_group_test.exs` - 9 tests, 0 failures\n- `mix test --include integration test/integration/telegram_group_management_test.exs` - 1 test, 0 failures\n- `mix credo --strict ...` - 83 mods/funs, found no issues\n- `MIX_ENV=prod mix compile` - passed with pre-existing warnings in Allora/Mira modules\n- `git diff --check`\n\nBounty wallet if accepted: `0x38938CB6Fd54172C5E82a5d01a9236fF12E84BdF`","createdAt":"2026-05-14T02:11:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4446824323","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCQ8jAw","author":{"login":"CusGroup"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi, I’d like to work on this Telegram Group Management bounty if it’s still open.\n\nI have practical experience with Telegram bot behavior, moderation-style routing, and safe message handling. I’d first align with the expected permission/member-management model, then implement the smallest useful set of group-management capabilities in a focused PR.\n\nPlan:\n1. Review existing Telegram/lens architecture.\n2. Map group admin actions and permission boundaries.\n3. Implement member/permission/moderation operations with clear error paths.\n4. Add validation notes/tests for maintainers.\n\nPlease confirm assignment rules before I begin.","createdAt":"2026-05-14T02:39:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4446954243","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCZSY3Q","author":{"login":"zp6"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi! I'd like to work on this issue. I'll implement complete group management prisms including member management, permission system, content moderation, spam protection, group settings, channel post management, and admin action logging with comprehensive test coverage. Will submit a PR shortly.","createdAt":"2026-05-15T00:02:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4455700701","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCaScbw","author":{"login":"laolaoqi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi, I'd like to work on Telegram Group Management. I have experience building moderation bots and group management tools.\n\nMy approach:\n- Group member management (join/leave tracking, role assignment)\n- Moderation features (ban, mute, warn, auto-moderation rules)\n- Welcome messages and onboarding flows\n- Group settings management\n- Analytics dashboard integration\n\nTimeline: 7-10 days after scope discussion. Happy to discuss details on Discord.\n\nPayment wallet: 0xdFc476D7Bb10230B26500eEE24e300B26d253561","createdAt":"2026-05-15T03:55:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4456750191","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCatR7Q","author":{"login":"laolaoqi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"?? Interested in Telegram Group Management (,800) bounty. Experience building group management bots with permission systems, spam filtering, and moderation tools. Delivery within 2 weeks. Payment: 0xdFc476D7Bb10230B26500eEE24e300B26d253561","createdAt":"2026-05-15T05:38:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4457189869","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABIvaY7A","author":{"login":"sureshchouksey8"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Implemented in PR #885. The PR maps issue #65's Telegram Group Management acceptance criteria to moderation prisms, permission handlers, chat-info lenses, settings prisms, and focused tests. Requesting bounty review when convenient.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T10:01:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4881553644","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABI0SFRA","author":{"login":"sureshchouksey8"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Implemented in PR #885. The PR maps issue #65's Telegram Group Management acceptance criteria to moderation prisms, permission handlers, chat-info lenses, settings prisms, and focused tests. Requesting bounty review when convenient.","createdAt":"2026-07-05T16:02:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4886660420","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABI6tKrg","author":{"login":"hyperxiaoerxz-hash"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I read the Telegram group-management bounty. I would split this into permission/admin primitives first, then moderation workflows and group event handling, with tests for Telegram role edge cases.\n\nRelevant Telegram automation repo: https://github.com/hyperxiaoerxz-hash/telegram-bounty-scanner\n\nIf this is still open, I can help with a focused implementation slice around admin state, permission checks, and moderation actions before expanding into the full group-management surface.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T13:32:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65#issuecomment-4893395630","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2025-02-25T10:13:53Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDONlDJhc8AAAAB6PoGQw","name":"bounty","description":"","color":"395808"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"Telegram Group Management ($1,800)","updatedAt":"2026-07-06T13:32:44Z","url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/65"}
